feasibility" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Business Operations (MSME)</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">For founders whose business has outgrown the way it is run: clear roles, reporting, accountability and performance systems, plus process and automation readiness.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/msme-consulting" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></div></div></section><section aria-label="Credentials" class="border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal grid gap-6 divide-y divide-ink-tint py-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-3 sm:divide-x sm:divide-y-0 sm:py-10"><p class="px-4 pt-6 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink first:pt-0 sm:pt-0">PhD in Management</p><p class="px-4 pt-6 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink first:pt-0 sm:pt-0">Higher-education and skill-institution advisory across Gujarat</p><p class="px-4 pt-6 text-[15px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-ink first:pt-0 sm:pt-0">Founder-led: every engagement delivered by Dr. Sagar Burse</p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="engagements-heading" class="section-y bord